6. Elia refers to unscheduled streams as "gorilla streams," indicating her preference for spontaneous content similar to Twitch culture. (Verbatim: "A gorilla is going to be, like, out of nowhere. I feel like on Twitch, it's a lot more common to just start streaming, right?")

7. Elia experiences anxiety and worry, especially about audience turnout for her streams. (Verbatim: "I get worried with gorillas, because I'm like, Will people turn up? Will people turn up?")

