8. As a child, she was more interested in playing with Legos than focusing on academic pressure. (Verbatim: "I was literally there looking at some kid playing with legos and i'm like i want to play the lego lego i want to play lego.")

9. She has difficulty with music and does not consider it one of her strengths. (Verbatim: "Music is not my forte at all in the slightest like I wish I was better at music but it was definitely something I never picked up easy.")

10. She once ate glue when she was six years old. (Verbatim: "When I was six I was eating glue.") [end of text]



1. She is a British VTuber. (Verbatim: "I am Elias Delvaria British VTuber not a melodica player.")
